  "d2: 🍽️ Maya taps the pantry's fullest jar. \"More than we can eat before it turns. Rendering fat instead — the lamps won't fill themselves.\"",
  "d2: 🍽️ Maya taps the pantry door — full to bursting — and keeps the day's share in hand. \"Dinner's on me tonight, then.\"",
  "d3: 🍽️ Skylar takes one look at the full shelves and unshoulders the pack. \"Leave the wild standing. Hauling water for the cistern.\"",
  "d3: 🍽️ Aria carries the day's surplus to the pantry door, thinks better of it, and turns back to the fire. \"It'll only rot in there. We eat.\"",
  "d5: 🍽️ Maya eyes the groaning pantry shelves and packs light today. \"No point hauling what'll rot. Mending the nets instead.\"",
  "d5: 🍽️ Skylar carries the day's surplus to the pantry door, thinks better of it, and turns back to the fire. \"It'll only rot in there. We eat.\"",
  "d6: 🍽️ Leo leaves the foraging basket at the door. \"The pantry can't take more — sitting with the elders instead.\"",
  "d6: 🍽️ Dmitri carries the day's surplus to the pantry door, thinks better of it, and turns back to the fire. \"It'll only rot in there. We eat.\"",
  "d7: 🍽️ Dmitri peeks into the pantry, then turns the foraging party back. \"Plenty for days. Teaching the kids snares instead — they'll need to know.\"",
  "d7: 🍽️ Sari looks at the full shelves and waves off the day's share. \"No more into the store — we eat at the fire, and the shelves keep.\"",
  "d8: 🍽️ Dmitri weighs the day's basket against the pantry shelves and puts it down. \"Enough. Carving bowls instead — we're down to the cracked ones.\"",
  "d8: 🍽️ Aria sets the sharing basket down by the fire instead of the pantry. \"Full shelves don't need my little more.\"",
  "d10: 🍽️ Aria eyes the groaning pantry shelves and packs light today. \"No point hauling what'll rot. Mending the nets instead.\"",
